        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Merrill runs an Advisor Development Program (ADP), a training program with roles that progress to Merrill Core Advisor, to develop new financial advisors.",
            "quote": "After mastering key objectives and pre-determined targets, progress through three roles until you graduate to Merrill Core Advisor.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "MER-PR-web-advisor-development-program#1"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Merrill continues to add financial advisors to the sales force through its extensive training program and experienced hiring of advisors.",
            "quote": "We also continued to add financial advisors to the sales force in Merrill and the Private Bank through our extensive training program and experienced hiring of advisors.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2025-06-30",
            "scope": "Merrill and Private Bank",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "BAC-TR-2025Q2#34"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Borthwick states the firm is picking up the recruiting of experienced advisors and that the training program is ultimately what drives net new flows.",
            "quote": "the Merrill FA see the value of our franchise... and we're picking up the recruiting of experienced advisors. That isn't an enormous part of our strategy, but it's a training program so that we're training people in wealth management...",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2025-12-31",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "BAC-TR-2025Q4#106"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Borthwick states adviser attrition is now at near historic lows and the goal is to keep growing the sales force.",
            "quote": "So I think what Lindsay and Eric are trying to drive there... is just keep growing the sales force. Well, adviser attrition is now at near historic lows.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2026-06-30",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "BAC-TR-2026Q2#63"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Merrill returned to veteran broker recruiting after pulling back at end of 2017, and recruited assets doubled year-over-year.",
            "quote": "Merrill executives in October touted that recruited assets to the wealth unit doubled year-over-year as the firm has returned to veteran broker recruiting.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2026-10",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "MER-TRADE-2026-11-16-AH-01#1"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Merrill was recognized for having 446 advisors named to the 2025 Forbes Top Next-Generation Wealth Advisors list.",
            "quote": "Merrill had 446 advisors named to the 2025 Forbes \"Top Next-Generation Wealth Advisors Best-in-State\" list",
